# Creek Landscape

Unreal Engine project files, scenes and gameplay systems.

## Open the project

Open the `.uproject` file in a compatible Unreal Engine editor.

## Included files

- 1 Unreal project file(s)
- 4 map file(s)
- 622 asset file(s)

## Demo status

Source files are available. A verified playable demo is still required.

Project documentation and notices are retained in [project notes](PROJECT_NOTES.md) and the source files.
